---
import BrandLogo from './NextLogo.astro';
---

<nav class="nav-shell" aria-label="Navigazione principale">
	<div class="nav-inner">
		<a href="#top" class="brand" aria-label="Volontariando — Torna all'inizio">
			<BrandLogo class="brand-mark" />
			<span>Volontariando</span>
		</a>
		<div class="nav-links">
			<a href="#problema">Problema</a>
			<a href="#piattaforma">Piattaforma</a>
			<a href="#potenziale">Potenziale</a>
			<a href="#partner">Partner</a>
			<a href="#team">Chi siamo</a>
		</div>
		<a href="#contatti" class="nav-cta">Parliamone</a>
	</div>
</nav>

<main>
	<section id="top" class="hero">
		<div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="hero-glow hero-glow-blue" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="hero-glow hero-glow-violet" aria-hidden="true"></div>

		<div class="hero-inner">
			<div class="hero-copy reveal-on-scroll">
				<h1>
					Il volontariato diventa
					<span>parte della vita.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="hero-lead">
					Uniamo cittadini, enti del Terzo Settore e imprese in un unico ecosistema semplice, verificabile e orientato all’impatto.
				</p>
				<div class="hero-actions">
					<a href="#contatti" class="button button-primary">
						Scopri il progetto
						<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
					</a>
					<a href="#piattaforma" class="button button-secondary">Vedi come funziona</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="hero-product reveal-on-scroll">
				<div class="product-shell">
					<div class="product-window-bar" aria-hidden="true">
						<span></span><span></span><span></span>
					</div>

					<div class="product-toolbar">
						<div class="product-brand">
							<BrandLogo class="product-mark" />
							<div>
								<strong>Volontariando</strong>
								<span>Esplora opportunità</span>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="profile-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
					</div>

					<div class="product-content">
						<div class="opportunities">
							<div class="panel-heading">
								<div>
									<strong>Attività di comunità</strong>
								</div>
								<em>12 nuove</em>
							</div>
							<div class="activity-list">
								<div class="activity-row">
									<div class="activity-symbol symbol-blue">A</div>
									<div class="activity-name">
										<strong>Ambiente &amp; natura</strong>
										<span>3h · 2 km</span>
									</div>
									<strong class="activity-score">92%</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="activity-row">
									<div class="activity-symbol symbol-ochre">S</div>
									<div class="activity-name">
										<strong>Supporto scolastico</strong>
										<span>4h · 4 km</span>
									</div>
									<strong class="activity-score">87%</strong>
								</div>
								<div class="activity-row">
									<div class="activity-symbol symbol-green">C</div>
									<div class="activity-name">
										<strong>Inclusione sociale</strong>
										<span>2h · 6 km</span>
									</div>
									<strong class="activity-score">81%</strong>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="impact-panel">
							<div>
								<strong>24h</strong>
								<small>questo mese</small>
							</div>
							<div class="impact-bars" aria-hidden="true">
								<i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="metrics" aria-label="Dati principali">
		<div class="metrics-inner">
			<article class="metric-cell">
				<strong>4,7 mln</strong>
				<span>persone coinvolte in volontariato nel 2023</span>
			</article>
			<article class="metric-cell">
				<strong>−1,9 mln</strong>
				<span>calo rispetto al 2013 nella partecipazione</span>
			</article>
			<article class="metric-cell">
				<strong>3 vie</strong>
				<span>cittadini, enti e imprese in un solo circuito</span>
			</article>
			<article class="metric-cell">
				<strong>ESG</strong>
				<span>dati verificabili per la rendicontazione</span>
			</article>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="problema" class="section problem-section">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<header class="editorial-header reveal-on-scroll">
				<h2>Un valore enorme,<span>bloccato da attriti.</span></h2>
			</header>

			<div class="problem-bento">
				<article class="problem-feature reveal-on-scroll">
					<h3>Il volontariato è difficile da trovare</h3>
					<p>Annunci vaghi, appuntamenti rigidi e moduli cartacei trasformano una buona intenzione in una rinuncia.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="problem-item reveal-on-scroll">
					<h3>Gli enti perdono tempo in burocrazia</h3>
					<p>Turni, presenze, assicurazioni e rendicontazioni assorbono risorse preziose sottratte alle attività sul campo.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="problem-item reveal-on-scroll">
					<h3>Le imprese faticano a dimostrare l’impatto</h3>
					<p>Senza dati certi, il volontariato d’impresa resta difficile da organizzare e da usare nella rendicontazione ESG.</p>
				</article>

				<article class="problem-stat reveal-on-scroll">
					<h3>4,7 milioni di persone hanno fatto volontariato</h3>
					<p>Una base sociale ampia. Eppure la partecipazione è diminuita di 1,9 milioni di volontari rispetto al 2013.</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="piattaforma" class="section platform-section">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<header class="section-heading reveal-on-scroll">
				<h2>Da una buona intenzione<span>a un impatto concreto.</span></h2>
			</header>

			<div class="steps-layout">
				<article class="step-feature reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="step-copy">
						<h3>Scopri</h3>
						<p>Trova opportunità vicine, trasparenti e compatibili con il tempo realmente disponibile.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="discovery-ui" aria-hidden="true">
						<div class="ui-pill">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s6-5.1 6-11a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 5.9 6 11 6 11Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2"/></svg>
							Vicino a te
						</div>
						<div class="ui-pill">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"/></svg>
							2–4 ore
						</div>
						<div class="ui-pill">
							<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 20c-3-2-7-5-7-9a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.7A4 4 0 0 1 19 11c0 4-4 7-7 9Z"/></svg>
							Ambiente
						</div>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="step-item reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="step-copy">
						<h3>Agisci</h3>
						<p>Iscriviti in pochi clic, con turni e responsabilità chiari, direttamente sul campo.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="check-ui" aria-hidden="true">
						<div><span>✓</span><strong>Disponibilità confermata</strong></div>
						<div><span>✓</span><strong>Documenti completati</strong></div>
					</div>
				</article>

				<article class="step-item reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="step-copy">
						<h3>Misura</h3>
						<p>Ore, competenze e risultati diventano evidenze verificabili per persone, enti e imprese.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="measure-ui" aria-hidden="true">
						<i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
					</div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section ecosystem-section">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<header class="ecosystem-heading reveal-on-scroll">
				<h2>Ciascuno porta valore.<span>Tutti lo ritrovano.</span></h2>
			</header>

			<div class="ecosystem-bento">
				<article class="ecosystem-primary reveal-on-scroll">
					<div>
						<h3>Cittadini</h3>
						<p>Opportunità vicine, flessibili e trasparenti. Un portfolio digitale certifica ore e competenze.</p>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Micro-volontariato</li>
						<li>Profilo e attestazioni</li>
						<li>Matching per interessi</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="ecosystem-secondary reveal-on-scroll">
					<div>
						<h3>Enti del Terzo Settore</h3>
						<p>Gestione integrata di turni, presenze e comunicazione, con visibilità e strumenti.</p>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Vetrina pubblica</li>
						<li>Calendario e candidati</li>
						<li>Rendicontazione rapida</li>
					</ul>
				</article>

				<article class="ecosystem-secondary ecosystem-ochre reveal-on-scroll">
					<div>
						<h3>Imprese</h3>
						<p>Programmi chiavi in mano e dashboard ESG per misurare ore, partecipazione e impatto territoriale.</p>
					</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Team building solidale</li>
						<li>Servizi pro-bono</li>
						<li>Dati per la rendicontazione</li>
					</ul>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="potenziale" class="section potential-section">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<header class="potential-header reveal-on-scroll">
				<div>
					<h2>La domanda è già sul mercato.<span>Serve l’infrastruttura giusta.</span></h2>
				</div>
				<p>
					Normative europee, pressione ESG e cambiamento dei modelli di lavoro rendono urgente una misura
					affidabile dell’impatto sociale.
				</p>
			</header>

			<div class="potential-grid">
				<article class="potential-card reveal-on-scroll">
					<strong>CSRD</strong>
					<p>Le grandi imprese europee devono rendicontare impatti, rischi e opportunità sociali secondo standard comuni.</p>
					<small>Fonte: Commissione Europea</small>
				</article>

				<article class="potential-card reveal-on-scroll">
					<strong>50k+</strong>
					<p>Le imprese soggette alla CSRD hanno bisogno di dati strutturati sull’impatto sociale delle proprie attività.</p>
					<small>Riferimento europeo</small>
				</article>

				<article class="potential-card potential-card-warm reveal-on-scroll">
					<strong>Territorio</strong>
					<p>Ogni ente verificato rende la rete più utile; ogni impresa finanzia infrastruttura e crescita locale.</p>
					<small>Il vantaggio strategico di Volontariando</small>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="partner" class="partner-section">
		<div class="section-inner partner-inner">
			<p class="partner-label reveal-on-scroll">Con chi collaboriamo</p>
			<div class="partner-grid">
				<article class="reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="partner-logo-box">
						<strong>Impact Hub</strong>
					</div>
					<span>Innovazione &amp; impatto</span>
				</article>
				<article class="reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="partner-logo-box">
						<strong>CREA</strong>
					</div>
					<span>Ricerca &amp; sviluppo territoriale</span>
				</article>
				<article class="reveal-on-scroll">
					<div class="partner-logo-box">
						<strong>CSV Estense</strong>
					</div>
					<span>CSV territoriale</span>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="team" class="section team-section">
		<div class="section-inner team-layout">
			<header class="team-story reveal-on-scroll">
				<h2>Costruiamo ponti tra tecnologia e comunità.</h2>
				<p>Siamo un team interdisciplinare con una visione: rendere la partecipazione civica una pratica quotidiana, accessibile e misurabile.</p>
			</header>

			<div class="team-roles reveal-on-scroll">
				<article class="role-row">
					<div class="role-info">
						<h3>Product &amp; Technology</h3>
						<p>Persone che vogliono costruire un prodotto utile, robusto e umano.</p>
					</div>
					<a href="#contatti">Contribuisci <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="role-row">
					<div class="role-info">
						<h3>Growth &amp; Partnerships</h3>
						<p>Collaboratori capaci di aprire relazioni con enti, università e imprese.</p>
					</div>
					<a href="#contatti">Contribuisci <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>

				<article class="role-row">
					<div class="role-info">
						<h3>Impact &amp; Community</h3>
						<p>Persone con esperienza nel Terzo Settore, volontariato e cambiamento sociale.</p>
					</div>
					<a href="#contatti">Contribuisci <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</article>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="contatti" class="contact-section">
		<div class="section-inner">
			<div class="contact-shell reveal-on-scroll">
				<div class="contact-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
				<div class="contact-layout">
					<header>
						<h2>Vuoi conoscere il progetto da vicino?</h2>
						<p>Scegli con noi il prossimo passo: una call conoscitiva, una partnership o la presentazione completa del progetto.</p>
					</header>

					<article class="contact-card">
						<div class="contact-person">
							<div class="contact-mark">DR</div>
							<div>
								<strong>Davide Rivieccio</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
						<a href="mailto:davide.rivieccio@volontariando.it">
							davide.rivieccio@volontariando.it
							<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
						</a>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</main>

<footer>
	<div class="footer-inner">
		<div class="footer-brand">
			<BrandLogo class="footer-mark" />
			<strong>Volontariando</strong>
		</div>
		<p>© 2026 Volontariando. Innovazione sociale.</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<script>
	const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
		(entries) => {
			entries.forEach((entry) => {
				if (entry.isIntersecting) {
					entry.target.classList.add('is-visible');
					observer.unobserve(entry.target);
				}
			});
		},
		{ threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' }
	);

	document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-on-scroll').forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
</script>

<style>
	:root {
		--navy-main: #07111F;
		--navy-dark: #0B1728;
		--navy-card: #10203A;
		--navy-green: #10283A;
		--dark-violet: #2A2533;
		--blue-primary: #2F67FF;
		--blue-light: #9CC5FF;
		--ochre-primary: #FFB84D;
		--ochre-light: #FFC874;
		--ochre-soft: #FFD891;
		--cream-text: #F7F8F4;
		--cream-ui: #F4F6F1;
	}

	/* Contenimento globale rigoroso per NextLogo.astro */
	:global(.brand-logo-box) {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		line-height: 0;
	}
	:global(.brand-logo-box svg) {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		max-width: 100%;
		max-height: 100%;
		object-fit: contain;
		display: block;
	}

	main,
	footer {
		overflow-x: clip;
		background: var(--navy-main);
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-family: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
	}

	/* Navbar */
	.nav-shell {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0 0 auto;
		z-index: 50;
		height: 68px;
		background: rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.78);
		backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(22px);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.10);
	}
	.nav-inner,
	.hero-inner,
	.metrics-inner,
	.section-inner,
	.footer-inner {
		width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px));
		margin-inline: auto;
	}
	.nav-inner {
		height: 68px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}
	.brand {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	.brand span {
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 17px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}
	:global(.brand-mark) {
		width: 34px;
		height: 25px;
	}
	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 32px;
	}
	.nav-links a {
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nav-links a:hover {
		color: var(--cream-text);
	}
	.nav-cta {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		height: 36px;
		padding: 0 18px;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: var(--blue-primary);
		color: var(--cream-text);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nav-cta:hover {
		background: var(--ochre-primary);
		color: var(--navy-main);
	}

	/* Tipografia */
	h1,
	h2,
	h3 {
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		margin: 0;
	}
	h1,
	h2 {
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
		line-height: 1.06;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--cream-text);
	}
	h1 span,
	h2 span {
		display: block;
		color: rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.72);
	}

	/* Hero Apple Keynote Style */
	.hero {
		position: relative;
		padding: 156px 0 112px;
		background: var(--navy-main);
	}
	.hero-grid,
	.contact-grid {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		background-image:
			linear-gradient(rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
			linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
		background-size: 72px 72px;
		mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 35%, rgba(7, 17, 31, 1), transparent 85%);
	}
	.hero-glow {
		position: absolute;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		filter: blur(135px);
		pointer-events: none;
		opacity: 0.17;
	}
	.hero-glow-blue {
		width: 620px;
		height: 420px;
		left: 50%;
		top: 320px;
		transform: translateX(-65%);
		background: var(--blue-primary);
	}
	.hero-glow-violet {
		width: 540px;
		height: 380px;
		left: 50%;
		top: 360px;
		transform: translateX(-15%);
		background: var(--dark-violet);
	}
	.hero-inner {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.hero-copy {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 820px;
		margin-inline: auto;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: clamp(44px, 6.2vw, 80px);
	}
	.hero-lead {
		max-width: 610px;
		margin: 26px auto 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.74);
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1.68;
	}
	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 36px;
	}
	.button {
		height: 50px;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 10px;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		padding: 0 26px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), background 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
	}
	.button-primary {
		background: var(--blue-primary);
		color: var(--cream-text);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(47, 103, 255, 0.24);
	}
	.button-primary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		background: var(--ochre-primary);
		color: var(--navy-main);
	}
	.button-secondary {
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.38);
		color: var(--ochre-light);
		background: rgba(16, 32, 58, 0.45);
	}
	.button-secondary:hover {
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		border-color: var(--ochre-primary);
		background: rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.10);
	}

	/* Product Stage */
	.hero-product {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 940px;
		margin-top: 68px;
	}
	.product-shell {
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.16);
		border-radius: 26px;
		background: var(--navy-card);
		padding: 14px;
		box-shadow:
			inset 0 1px 0 rgba(247, 248, 244, 0.10),
			0 40px 100px rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.70);
	}
	.product-window-bar {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 7px;
		padding: 2px 6px 12px;
	}
	.product-window-bar span {
		width: 9px;
		height: 9px;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.22);
	}
	.product-window-bar span:first-child {
		background: rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.55);
	}
	.product-toolbar {
		height: 68px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding: 0 22px;
		border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
		background: var(--cream-ui);
		color: var(--navy-main);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.08);
	}
	.product-brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 12px;
	}
	:global(.product-mark) {
		width: 34px;
		height: 25px;
	}
	.product-brand strong {
		display: block;
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.product-brand span {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 2px;
		color: rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.55);
		font-size: 11px;
	}
	.profile-dot {
		width: 34px;
		height: 34px;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: var(--ochre-soft);
		border: 1px solid rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.08);
	}
	.product-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 240px;
		gap: 12px;
		padding-top: 12px;
	}
	.opportunities {
		min-width: 0;
		border-radius: 0 0 0 16px;
		background: var(--cream-ui);
		padding: 22px;
	}
	.panel-heading {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
	}
	.panel-heading strong {
		color: var(--navy-main);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 16px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.panel-heading em {
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: rgba(47, 103, 255, 0.12);
		color: var(--blue-primary);
		padding: 6px 12px;
		font-size: 11px;
		font-style: normal;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.activity-list {
		display: grid;
		gap: 10px;
		margin-top: 16px;
	}
	.activity-row {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 14px;
		min-height: 62px;
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: var(--cream-text);
		padding: 10px 14px;
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.06);
	}
	.activity-symbol {
		width: 40px;
		height: 40px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 11px;
		color: var(--navy-main);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.symbol-blue {
		background: var(--blue-light);
	}
	.symbol-ochre {
		background: var(--ochre-soft);
	}
	.symbol-green {
		background: var(--ochre-light);
	}
	.activity-name strong {
		display: block;
		color: var(--navy-main);
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.activity-name span {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 2px;
		color: rgba(7, 17, 31, 0.55);
		font-size: 11px;
	}
	.activity-score {
		color: var(--blue-primary);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.impact-panel {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: space-between;
		border-radius: 0 0 16px 0;
		background: var(--blue-primary);
		color: var(--cream-text);
		padding: 24px;
	}
	.impact-panel strong {
		display: block;
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 40px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		line-height: 1;
	}
	.impact-panel small {
		display: block;
		margin-top: 6px;
		font-size: 12px;
		opacity: 0.85;
	}
	.impact-bars {
		height: 108px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		gap: 7px;
		margin-top: 24px;
	}
	.impact-bars i {
		flex: 1;
		border-radius: 4px 4px 1px 1px;
		background: var(--cream-text);
		opacity: 0.88;
	}
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(1) { height: 32%; }
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(2) { height: 52%; }
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(3) { height: 42%; }
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(4) { height: 74%; }
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(5) { height: 60%; }
	.impact-bars i:nth-child(6) { height: 92%; background: var(--ochre-soft); opacity: 1; }

	/* Metrics Strip */
	.metrics {
		background: var(--navy-dark);
		border-block: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.metrics-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
	}
	.metric-cell {
		padding: 36px 28px;
		border-right: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.metric-cell:first-child {
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.metric-cell strong {
		display: block;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 32px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
	}
	.metric-cell:nth-child(3) strong,
	.metric-cell:nth-child(4) strong {
		color: var(--ochre-primary);
	}
	.metric-cell span {
		display: block;
		max-width: 210px;
		margin-top: 8px;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.65);
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	/* Sezioni Generali */
	.section {
		padding: 120px 0;
	}
	.editorial-header h2,
	.section-heading h2,
	.ecosystem-heading h2,
	.potential-header h2 {
		font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 66px);
	}

	/* Sezione Problema (Bento Grid 12 colonne equilibrata) */
	.problem-section {
		background: var(--navy-main);
	}
	.editorial-header {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-bottom: 64px;
	}
	.problem-bento {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
		gap: 0;
	}
	.problem-feature,
	.problem-item,
	.problem-stat {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}
	.problem-feature {
		grid-column: span 6;
		min-height: 280px;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 24px 64px 24px 0;
	}
	.problem-feature h3 {
		max-width: 520px;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 52px);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.08;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}
	.problem-feature p {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 22px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 17px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.problem-stat {
		grid-column: span 12;
		min-height: 0;
		margin-top: 48px;
		padding-top: 38px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr;
		align-items: start;
		gap: 48px;
	}
	.problem-stat h3 {
		color: var(--ochre-primary);
		max-width: 560px;
		font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 42px);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.12;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}
	.problem-stat p {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.78);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.problem-item {
		grid-column: span 3;
		min-height: 280px;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 24px 28px;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.problem-item h3 {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: 22px;
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.24;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.problem-item p {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.68;
	}

	/* Sezione Piattaforma (3 colonne allineate verticalmente) */
	.platform-section {
		background: var(--navy-dark);
	}
	.section-heading {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-bottom: 56px;
	}
	.steps-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 0;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.step-feature,
	.step-item {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: space-between;
		min-height: 420px;
		padding: 8px 48px 8px 0;
	}
	.step-feature {
		background: transparent;
	}
	.step-item {
		padding: 8px 48px;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.step-copy h3 {
		margin: 0 0 14px;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.12;
		letter-spacing: -0.035em;
	}
	.step-copy p {
		max-width: 360px;
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.75);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.discovery-ui,
	.check-ui,
	.measure-ui {
		height: 156px;
		margin-top: 44px;
	}
	.discovery-ui {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.ui-pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		min-height: 44px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		background: transparent;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		padding: 0 14px 0 0;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.ui-pill svg {
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		fill: none;
		stroke: var(--ochre-primary);
		stroke-width: 1.8;
	}
	.check-ui {
		display: grid;
		align-content: center;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.check-ui div {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 11px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		padding: 15px 0;
	}
	.check-ui div:last-child {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.check-ui div span {
		width: 24px;
		height: 24px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: var(--ochre-soft);
		color: var(--navy-main);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.check-ui strong {
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.measure-ui {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-end;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 10px;
		padding: 24px;
	}
	.measure-ui i {
		width: 34px;
		border-radius: 6px 6px 2px 2px;
		background: var(--ochre-primary);
	}
	.measure-ui i:nth-child(1) { height: 36px; opacity: 0.65; }
	.measure-ui i:nth-child(2) { height: 58px; opacity: 0.8; }
	.measure-ui i:nth-child(3) { height: 78px; opacity: 0.9; }
	.measure-ui i:nth-child(4) { height: 100px; }

	/* Sezione Ecosistema (Bento Asimmetrica) */
	.ecosystem-section {
		background: var(--navy-main);
	}
	.ecosystem-heading {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-bottom: 64px;
	}
	.ecosystem-bento {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
		gap: 0;
	}
	.ecosystem-primary,
	.ecosystem-secondary {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: space-between;
		min-height: 390px;
		padding: 8px 48px 8px 0;
	}
	.ecosystem-primary {
		grid-column: span 6;
		grid-row: auto;
	}
	.ecosystem-secondary {
		grid-column: span 3;
	}
	.ecosystem-ochre {
		padding-right: 0;
	}
	.ecosystem-primary h3 {
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}
	.ecosystem-primary p {
		max-width: 360px;
		margin: 16px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.68;
	}
	.ecosystem-secondary h3 {
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.ecosystem-secondary p {
		max-width: 360px;
		margin: 16px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.68;
	}
	.ecosystem-secondary {
		padding-left: 48px;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.ecosystem-primary ul,
	.ecosystem-secondary ul {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0;
		list-style: none;
		margin: 36px 0 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.ecosystem-primary li,
	.ecosystem-secondary li {
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		color: var(--cream-text);
		padding: 12px 0;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.ecosystem-secondary li:last-child,
	.ecosystem-primary li:last-child {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.ecosystem-ochre li {
		color: var(--ochre-soft);
	}

	/* Sezione Potenziale */
	.potential-section {
		background: var(--navy-dark);
	}
	.potential-header {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 56px;
	}
	.potential-header h2 {
		max-width: 1120px;
	}
	.potential-header h2 span {
		display: inline;
		margin-left: 0.18em;
	}
	.potential-header > p {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 24px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.potential-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr);
		gap: 0;
	}
	.potential-card {
		min-height: 330px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		padding: 8px 48px 8px 0;
	}
	.potential-card {
		grid-column: span 4;
	}
	.potential-card:first-child {
		grid-column: span 5;
	}
	.potential-card:last-child {
		grid-column: span 3;
	}
	.potential-card + .potential-card {
		padding-left: 48px;
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.potential-card:last-child {
		padding-right: 0;
	}
	.potential-card > strong {
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 64px);
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		line-height: 1;
	}
	.potential-card p {
		max-width: 340px;
		margin: 24px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.potential-card small {
		margin-top: auto;
		padding-top: 28px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		color: rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.55);
		font-size: 12px;
	}
	.potential-card-warm {
		background: transparent;
	}
	.potential-card-warm > strong {
		color: var(--ochre-primary);
	}

	/* Sezione Partner */
	.partner-section {
		background: var(--navy-main);
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
		padding: 64px 0;
	}
	.partner-label {
		margin: 0 0 18px;
		color: var(--blue-light);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}
	.partner-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 0;
	}
	.partner-grid article {
		min-height: 112px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		padding: 12px 32px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	.partner-grid article + article {
		border-left: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.12);
	}
	.partner-logo-box {
		width: 100%;
		height: 44px;
		max-width: 220px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.partner-logo-box strong {
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 21px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		max-width: 100%;
		max-height: 100%;
	}
	.partner-grid span {
		margin-top: 6px;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.56);
		font-size: 12px;
	}

	/* Sezione Chi Siamo & Ruoli */
	.team-section {
		background: var(--navy-main);
		padding-top: 96px;
		padding-bottom: 64px;
	}
	.team-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
		gap: 72px;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.team-story h2 {
		font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 52px);
	}
	.team-story p {
		max-width: 460px;
		margin: 22px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.72);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.role-row {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		padding: 28px 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.14);
	}
	.role-row:last-child {
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.14);
	}
	.role-info {
		max-width: 460px;
	}
	.role-row h3 {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		color: var(--cream-text);
		font-size: 19px;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}
	.role-row p {
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.68);
		font-size: 14px;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.role-row a {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		color: var(--blue-light);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 13px;
		font-weight: 600;
		white-space: nowrap;
		transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
	}
	.role-row a:hover {
		color: var(--ochre-primary);
		transform: translateX(3px);
	}

	/* Sezione Contatti (Card Architettonica) */
	.contact-section {
		background: var(--navy-main);
		padding: 48px 0 96px;
	}
	.contact-shell {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: 48px 0 0;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(156, 197, 255, 0.14);
	}
	.contact-grid {
		display: none;
	}
	.contact-layout {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 56px;
	}
	.contact-layout header h2 {
		max-width: 560px;
		font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px);
	}
	.contact-layout header p {
		max-width: 500px;
		margin: 20px 0 0;
		color: rgba(244, 246, 241, 0.76);
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.contact-card {
		border: 0;
		border-radius: 0;
		background: transparent;
		box-shadow: none;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.contact-person {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 16px;
		padding: 0 0 22px;
	}
	.contact-mark {
		width: 54px;
		height: 54px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: var(--ochre-primary);
		color: var(--navy-main);
		font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
		font-size: 15px;
